Package: apt-cleaner
Version: 1.0-2
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Local Administrator <admin@localhost>
Depends: apt, sudo
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: APT package cleanup tool for KDE Plasma
 Opens a terminal window to run apt-get autoremove --purge and apt-get clean,
 displays a completion status message, and waits for user interaction before exiting.
